        "aiSupplement": {
          "explanation": [
            {
              "text": "Hydrostatic pressure drives fluid across the glomerular filtration barrier. Fenestrated endothelium, the basement membrane and filtration slits permit water and small solutes to enter the capsule while retaining cells and most large proteins.",
